      "bio": "Prasant Balaji Dhokte works across off-plan developments in the UAE, assisting clients in\nidentifying early-stage opportunities with a focus on structured, high-value decision-making.\nWith two years of experience, he is known for his focused approach, strong follow-through, and\nability to simplify project evaluation for HNI investors. His work centers on select developer\nportfolios, helping clients assess opportunities based on location strength, project fundamentals,\nand long-term appreciation potential. He maintains a disciplined, client-focused approach to\nensure clarity and confidence throughout the investment journey.",
