      "bio": "Mariya Thomas supports clients across end-use and investment-focused property decisions in\nthe UAE, helping them navigate opportunities with clarity and structure. With four years of\nexperience, she is known for her client-focused approach, consistent communication, and ability\nto simplify project evaluation across a competitive market. Her focus spans developments from\nselect established and emerging developers, guiding clients based on location strength,\ncommunity value, and long-term potential. She maintains a practical, detail-oriented approach\nthat helps clients make confident and well-informed property decisions at every stage of the\njourney.",
