      "bio": "Sreelakshmi Appar works with investors across UAE real estate, focusing on identifying\nopportunities aligned with long-term capital growth and portfolio stability. With over 16 years of\nexperience across multiple professional fields, she brings a broad, well-rounded perspective to\nclient advisory, supported by strong market understanding and structured decision-making. Her\nfocus is on helping investors evaluate opportunities based on fundamentals such as location\nstrength, developer credibility, and long-term value creation. She brings a steady, insight-driven\napproach to ensure confident and well-structured investment decisions.",
