      "instagram": "",
      "linkedin": "",
      "facebook": "",
      "bio": "Purandaran S, Co-Founder, Triad Realty LLC, is a UAE-based investment advisor focused on\nstructuring and positioning high-conviction property investments across the UAE. He plays a\ncore role in driving investment direction, aligning private and institutional capital with off-plan\nand high-growth real estate opportunities. His focus is on disciplined asset selection, market\npositioning, and long-term value creation across residential master communities, waterfront\ndevelopments, branded residences, and luxury real estate. With strong developer relationships\nand deep market intelligence, he operates at the intersection of deal flow and investment\nadvisory. Through Triad Realty, he helps shape capital allocation into opportunities designed for\nsustained performance in Dubai’s evolving property landscape.",
      "videoUrl": "",
