      "linkedin": "",
      "facebook": "",
      "bio": "Didin Dileep, Co-Founder, Triad Realty LLC, is a UAE-based real estate entrepreneur with 6\nyears of experience across sales, marketing, investor relations, and business growth. He\nspearheads the company’s marketing, branding, and market positioning initiatives, driving Triad\nRealty’s presence across the GCC and international investment markets. His expertise lies at\nthe intersection of strategic marketing and real estate investment, enabling him to identify\nmarket opportunities, shape compelling investment narratives, and strengthen market influence.\nWorking closely with HNIs and real estate investors, he contributes to portfolio advisory, asset\nselection, and market positioning across off-plan and ready property segments, while driving\ninvestor engagement, portfolio growth, and long-term value creation across the UAE real estate\nsector.",
