      "facebook": "",
      "bio": "Gopikrishnan ES, Co-Founder, Triad Realty LLC, is a UAE-based investment strategist and\nentrepreneur with 12 years of high-performance experience across structured sales, investment\nexecution, and market expansion. He leads execution and growth strategy within the firm,\nfocusing on converting market access into scalable, high-yield real estate positions across\nluxury and commercial segments. His background in frontline sales and deal execution informs\na disciplined, data-led approach to negotiation, asset positioning, and transaction structuring.\nHe plays a key role in strengthening investor confidence, building market channels, and driving\nconsistent deal flow across core UAE developments. At Triad Realty, he focuses on expanding\nstructured investment opportunities and strengthening the firm’s positioning across key real\nestate segments in the UAE",
