      "id": "dubai-2026-outlook",
      "title": "Dubai Real Estate Outlook 2026: Where Smart Money Is Moving",
      "category": "Market Analysis",
      "author": "Sarah Al-Rashid",
      "date": "2026-01-08",
      "read_minutes": 8,
      "cover": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486406146926-c627a92ad1ab?crop=entropy&cs=srgb&fm=jpg&q=85",
      "excerpt": "A comprehensive breakdown of the locations, asset classes and price-bands set to outperform in the next 24 months.",
      "content": "Dubai enters 2026 with record transaction volumes, expanding investor visa programs, and a growing waterfront supply pipeline. In this report we examine the macro tailwinds, micro-market signals, and the eight neighbourhoods our analysts believe will lead returns through 2027."
    },
    {
      "id": "off-plan-vs-resale",
      "title": "Off-Plan vs Resale: The Honest Buyer's Guide for 2026",
      "category": "Buyer's Guide",
      "author": "Ahmed Hassan",
      "date": "2025-12-22",
      "read_minutes": 6,
      "cover": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560518883-ce09059eeffa?crop=entropy&cs=srgb&fm=jpg&q=85",
      "excerpt": "Payment plans, capital appreciation, rental yields — every variable that should inform your decision.",
      "content": "Off-plan and resale are not better or worse — they're different tools for different goals. We compare the trade-offs across capital outlay, time-to-yield, liquidity, and risk so you can match the asset to the strategy."
    },
